# Story page: nm-gale
# {name} becomes the snake's name. Paragraphs are separated by a blank line.
title = Nightmare: Hurricane
---
The wind found its voice, and it was a scream.

{name} was blown this way and that, a leaf with ambitions, a kite with no string, a snake with a great many opinions about weather.

'You go where you are pushed,' said the coil, 'until you don't.' I have been pushed a great deal. I am still waiting for the second part.
